1
00:00:03,220 --> 00:00:07,250
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

2
00:00:07,640 --> 00:00:11,860
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

3
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:16,120
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

4
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:20,330
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

5
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:22,200
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

6
00:00:22,250 --> 00:00:24,730
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

7
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:26,880
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

8
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:28,760
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

9
00:00:29,420 --> 00:00:30,650
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

10
00:00:30,930 --> 00:00:33,320
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

11
00:00:33,690 --> 00:00:35,800
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

12
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:40,560
♪Come, share a cup with me♪

13
00:00:40,570 --> 00:00:42,540
(Welcome to Cold Palace Refreshments)

14
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,040
=Farm Busily in the Cold Palace=

15
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:48,620
(Based on Hongshu.com's novel
I'm Busy Farming in the Cold Palace)

16
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,650
=Episode 24=

17
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:54,600
(Memorial Tablet of the Late Lu Yunluo)

18
00:00:55,719 --> 00:00:57,280
Your Highness!

19
00:00:57,280 --> 00:01:00,439
How could you leave us like this?

20
00:01:00,960 --> 00:01:03,359
His Majesty is waiting for your return!

21
00:01:03,359 --> 00:01:04,439
Your Highness!

22
00:01:04,879 --> 00:01:08,000
The people of Donglan need you!

23
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,439
Your Highness!

24
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:11,680
(Keep it down, will you?)

25
00:01:11,680 --> 00:01:13,560
(You'll lose your voice.)

26
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:15,359
(Once I sleep in my private realm,)

27
00:01:15,560 --> 00:01:19,000
(Donglan's empress will be no more.)

28
00:01:20,359 --> 00:01:21,879
Your Highness!

29
00:01:21,879 --> 00:01:24,640
Rest in peace, Your Highness.

30
00:01:25,719 --> 00:01:28,840
Rest in peace, Your Highness.

31
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,359
Ah!

32
00:01:32,799 --> 00:01:33,799
Hey.

33
00:01:34,519 --> 00:01:36,920
The Empress was stabbed here.

34
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,519
This could become a tourist attraction!

35
00:01:40,439 --> 00:01:41,519
Hurry up!

36
00:01:43,120 --> 00:01:45,519
From today, I'm free!

37
00:01:46,879 --> 00:01:47,719
My lady,

38
00:01:47,719 --> 00:01:49,079
we're fleeing for our lives.

39
00:01:49,079 --> 00:01:50,120
Please hurry!

40
00:01:50,599 --> 00:01:51,879
So long, everyone!

41
00:02:02,120 --> 00:02:03,000
Ha.

42
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:06,480
Donglan's empress is intriguing indeed.

43
00:02:09,360 --> 00:02:12,319
(Shuxin Hall
By Heaven's will, His Majesty decrees:)

44
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:15,639
(Empress Lu has passed away.)

45
00:02:15,759 --> 00:02:18,280
(The nation shall observe)

46
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:21,639
(three days of mourning.)

47
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,319
Lu Yunluo.

48
00:02:26,759 --> 00:02:28,039
You promised me.

49
00:02:30,159 --> 00:02:31,960
I was to see you off myself.

50
00:02:36,599 --> 00:02:37,759
How dare you?

51
00:02:40,479 --> 00:02:42,360
How dare you leave and not wait for me?

52
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:01,000
(Three Months Later
Tianxia Farming and Trade Guild)

53
00:03:01,639 --> 00:03:04,520
(Grand Opening)
Welcome to our new Tianxia branch!

54
00:03:05,159 --> 00:03:09,080
Rice, flour, grain, oil, fabrics, china,
cosmetics and jewelry!

55
00:03:09,120 --> 00:03:10,039
We've got it all!

56
00:03:10,319 --> 00:03:13,360
Get a membership card for 10 copper
coins today!

57
00:03:13,599 --> 00:03:15,159
(Tianxia Farming and Trade Guild)
Save 10% now!

58
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:16,879
Earn points with every purchase

59
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,639
and redeem them for goods!

60
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:19,879
Points?

61
00:03:20,879 --> 00:03:22,080
What can I get with points?

62
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:23,039
Ma'am,

63
00:03:23,039 --> 00:03:25,599
100 points gets you 250 grams of eggs.

64
00:03:25,879 --> 00:03:28,719
Member Days are the 8th and 18th of each
month.

65
00:03:28,960 --> 00:03:31,080
Double points, cheaper rice and flour!

66
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,039
Sign me up!

67
00:03:32,039 --> 00:03:33,560
No, give me three!

68
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:35,680
One each for my daughter and
daughter-in-law.

69
00:03:35,759 --> 00:03:36,560
Certainly!

70
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,319
Sign me up!

71
00:03:37,319 --> 00:03:39,080
Me first! My child's waiting to eat!

72
00:03:39,360 --> 00:03:40,159
Of course!

73
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:42,479
Yes.

74
00:03:42,479 --> 00:03:43,719
Come on in.

75
00:03:43,719 --> 00:03:45,800
(Grand Opening
Tianxia Farming and Trade Guild Branch)

76
00:03:50,159 --> 00:03:50,960
Come on in.

77
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:55,360
How did my lady know

78
00:03:55,360 --> 00:03:57,680
eggs would send these old ladies

79
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,199
into such a frenzy?

80
00:04:02,680 --> 00:04:04,919
Mr. Wang, you're joining too?

81
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:06,759
Of course!

82
00:04:06,919 --> 00:04:09,039
Last time Tianxia recruited franchisees,

83
00:04:09,479 --> 00:04:11,000
I hesitated for two months.

84
00:04:11,199 --> 00:04:14,000
Old Zhang next door signed up first.

85
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,439
And would you believe it?

86
00:04:15,439 --> 00:04:17,680
He's already opened his third branch!

87
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:22,199
Who exactly is Ms. Lu?

88
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:26,399
So young, yet so capable!

89
00:04:26,639 --> 00:04:28,160
I don't know who she is,

90
00:04:28,519 --> 00:04:32,000
but this franchise profit-sharing idea

91
00:04:32,639 --> 00:04:35,040
is like turning stones into gold.

92
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:35,519
Hey,

93
00:04:35,759 --> 00:04:36,680
I've heard

94
00:04:36,720 --> 00:04:38,399
everyone who works with her

95
00:04:38,439 --> 00:04:39,759
makes a profit.

96
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,519
Mr. Li,

97
00:04:51,839 --> 00:04:53,000
(Tianxia Franchise Agreement)
Here's your contract.

98
00:04:53,480 --> 00:04:55,000
If everything looks good,

99
00:04:55,079 --> 00:04:56,319
sign and leave your thumbprint.

100
00:04:58,160 --> 00:04:59,520
(Tianxia Franchise Agreement
Franchisee: Li)

101
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:05,240
Ms. Lu,

102
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:07,720
our fortunes are in your hands now.

103
00:05:07,959 --> 00:05:09,639
A lasting business benefits both sides.

104
00:05:09,639 --> 00:05:10,439
Next...

105
00:05:11,079 --> 00:05:11,680
Next...

106
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:12,839
Next, please.

107
00:05:15,199 --> 00:05:16,000
Ms. Lu,

108
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:20,199
I have a major deal to discuss with you.

109
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,160
Franchise contracts only today.

110
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,879
Business meetings require three days'
notice.

111
00:05:24,639 --> 00:05:25,279
Let's go.

112
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:28,399
If I submit a request now,

113
00:05:28,759 --> 00:05:31,120
will you accept it, Ms. Lu?

114
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:42,480
Three months and nine days.

115
00:05:43,560 --> 00:05:45,560
Your fake-death escape, Ms. Lu,

116
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:48,120
surprised me more than this guild.

117
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:51,079
Didn't Jia and Yi tell you?

118
00:05:51,399 --> 00:05:53,360
What took you so long, you miser?

119
00:05:55,279 --> 00:05:56,720
Consort Yao ruined the wheat.

120
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,360
To cover it up,

121
00:05:58,720 --> 00:06:00,279
she burned the entire field.

122
00:06:00,480 --> 00:06:01,120
What?

123
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,920
I had to reassure the people

124
00:06:03,439 --> 00:06:05,040
and restore order at court.

125
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,199
You're kidding!

126
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:10,279
I gave her the farming manual

127
00:06:10,279 --> 00:06:12,120
and told her wheat needs dry soil.

128
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:13,519
Don't water it!

129
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:16,319
She remembered "wheat absorbs sweat,"

130
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,399
and "be sure to water it often."

131
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:22,399
(Luckily, the wheat in my private realm
is ripe.)

132
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:25,000
(I'll find a way
to make up the grain shortage.)

133
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:28,519
I'm beset with troubles,

134
00:06:29,079 --> 00:06:29,879
while you, Ms. Lu,

135
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:32,879
are having quite a lovely time here.

136
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,680
Hardly!

137
00:06:36,240 --> 00:06:38,839
Just a small business, a little profit.

138
00:06:38,839 --> 00:06:40,600
Nothing compared to you, Your Majesty.

139
00:07:05,199 --> 00:07:07,600
Ji Wujue, what are you doing?

140
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,360
There are merchants outside!

141
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:10,600
I'm tired of ruling.

142
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:14,000
Why not be your bed warmer instead?

143
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:16,680
(My lady!)

144
00:07:16,680 --> 00:07:18,639
(The merchants are getting impatient.)

145
00:07:18,639 --> 00:07:20,120
Surely Ms. Lu is important enough

146
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:21,680
to keep them waiting.

147
00:07:23,199 --> 00:07:24,399
Brother,

148
00:07:24,399 --> 00:07:25,920
that's their third round of tea.

149
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,560
Keep pouring.

150
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:33,000
Where is Ms. Lu?

151
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,160
What kind of deal

152
00:07:34,160 --> 00:07:35,279
takes this long?

153
00:07:35,399 --> 00:07:36,600
Enjoy the tea and pastries.

154
00:07:36,720 --> 00:07:38,680
Why not swap some business tips?

155
00:07:40,199 --> 00:07:41,160
Alas.

156
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,120
Oh!

157
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:55,759
What a distinguished gentleman!

158
00:07:55,920 --> 00:07:58,120
You don't seem to be from Donglan.

159
00:07:59,800 --> 00:08:00,879
The He family of Beicang.

160
00:08:01,319 --> 00:08:03,199
We trade in sable fur and tiger bone.

161
00:08:04,079 --> 00:08:05,399
An honor to meet you.

162
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,439
Sorry for the wait.

163
00:08:17,560 --> 00:08:19,360
I was checking the accounts.

164
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:21,000
No wonder you took so long.

165
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:22,639
You were balancing the books.

166
00:08:22,639 --> 00:08:23,360
No trouble.

167
00:08:23,399 --> 00:08:24,879
No trouble at all.

168
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,399
Good things take time.

169
00:08:26,959 --> 00:08:29,160
Big deals come first, Ms. Lu.

170
00:08:29,839 --> 00:08:30,680
What a coincidence.

171
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,879
I'm here for a big deal too.

172
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:34,600
What sort of deal?

173
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:37,360
I've heard of your business acumen.

174
00:08:37,639 --> 00:08:40,159
Would you be interested in opening trade
routes to Beicang?

175
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,440
Of course I am.

176
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,000
Tell me more.

177
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:44,240
Ms. Lu,

178
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,080
I have a major deal

179
00:08:46,879 --> 00:08:48,080
to discuss with you.

180
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,440
And this is...

181
00:08:50,360 --> 00:08:51,159
Well...

182
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:52,519
He's...

183
00:08:52,879 --> 00:08:53,960
Business partner

184
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:55,279
and

185
00:08:55,639 --> 00:08:56,879
bed warmer.

186
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:03,399
So that's your taste, Ms. Lu?

187
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:07,639
And you are?

188
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,880
(May Wealth Flow In)

189
00:09:10,919 --> 00:09:13,279
He Lian of Beicang.

190
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:18,480
(May Wealth Flow In)

191
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:25,687
(End of Season 1)

192
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:49,350
♪By red walls and a dry well,
my crown gathers dust and frost♪

193
00:09:49,740 --> 00:09:53,960
♪With a hoe and a patch of wasteland,
I sow the moonlight♪

194
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:58,180
♪Who says the Cold Palace
holds nothing but tears?♪

195
00:09:58,240 --> 00:10:02,430
♪I choose to fill it with fragrant wine♪

196
00:10:02,770 --> 00:10:06,830
♪Cool dew, starry nights,
wheat sprouts in my hands♪

197
00:10:06,900 --> 00:10:11,080
♪I shape fields, not painted brows,
and fill them with hope♪

198
00:10:11,520 --> 00:10:14,890
♪Gold and silver bloom from the soil♪

199
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:20,040
♪I smile as the world storms on♪

200
00:10:21,700 --> 00:10:23,850
♪No finery to rival spring♪

201
00:10:24,030 --> 00:10:28,330
♪All I wish for are waves of green♪

202
00:10:30,740 --> 00:10:32,490
♪Where is beauty found?♪

203
00:10:32,670 --> 00:10:37,100
♪Just lift your eyes and see♪

204
00:10:37,660 --> 00:10:39,230
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

205
00:10:39,250 --> 00:10:41,720
♪Growing life's simple joys♪

206
00:10:41,790 --> 00:10:43,870
♪Bins full of grain, jars full of wine♪

207
00:10:44,030 --> 00:10:45,800
♪Better than dancing in silks♪

208
00:10:46,410 --> 00:10:47,680
♪Farming in the Cold Palace♪

209
00:10:47,910 --> 00:10:50,310
♪My heart longs for the world beyond♪

210
00:10:50,550 --> 00:10:52,850
♪Tending a courtyard full of life♪

211
00:10:53,130 --> 00:10:57,050
♪Come, share a cup with me♪
